{"dataItems":[{"id":"a7c4ac2f-5379-47c8-a13a-ff200feafbf8","dataCollectionId":"Recipes11","data":{"introduction":"This savory sourdough bread is studded with tangy sweet dried cranberries that re-hydrate during the rising and baking process. It is amazing when warmed or toasted with a bit of butter. Cranberry sourdough bread is truly a versatile bread that I like to serve with dinner or breakfast. I'm sure it's going to make fantastic grilled cheese sandwiches one day at my house. It would also be perfect for making crostini to serve with baked brie.","servings":"10-12","photo":"image://v1/577c92_a87976761d064a16acd97b4734723fe2~mv2.jpg/1500_1125/20171213_194807_edited.jpg","link-recipes-1-title":"/bread-and-sourdough/cranberry-sourdough-bread","url":"http://www.theglasspantry.com/single-post/2018/02/20/Cranberry-Sourdough-Bread","image":"wix:image://v1/577c92_dd57043651064cd290f3a258c67b9d10~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/20171230_160451.jpg#originWidth=4032&originHeight=3024","_id":"a7c4ac2f-5379-47c8-a13a-ff200feafbf8","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2023-02-17T18:37:31.248Z"},"title1":"Cranberry Sourdough Bread","shortDescription":" This savory sourdough bread is studded with tangy sweet dried cranberries that re-hydrate during the rising and baking process. It is amazing when warmed or toasted with a bit of butter. Cranberry sourdough bread is truly a versatile bread that I like to serve with dinner or breakfast. I'm sure it's going to make fantastic grilled cheese sandwiches one day at my house. It would also be perfect for making crostini to serve with baked brie.","link-recipes-1-all":"/recipes-1/","cookingTime":"40 minutes","_updatedDate":{"$date":"2023-02-17T23:15:03.214Z"},"recipesCatagoryCatagory":"/Recipes/catagory/Bread","preparationTime":"3 hours","ingredients":{"nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"foo","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"2 1/2 cups All Purpose Flour","decorations":[{"type":